Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple, Hazelnut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mommies! What to do?\NThis is a priceless book.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,16 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you say that this book is priceless?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Primary Instruction for Children valuable to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.98,0:01:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's...\N-Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who saved me was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me from the well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten about everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I dragged you on my hump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands are still falling off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that you forgot about everything.\NYou don’t remember anything good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I’m talking about the events of eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So this isn’t the first time you’ve fallen into a well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not looking around at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why is this book so priceless?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like one of the true masterpieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Again you are talking some kind of nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Waking up from a nightmare,\Nlike I was locked in a well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I immediately thought of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided it was because you helped me get out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but since then I have become
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,noticing how similar\Nyou are to the girl who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought it might be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If the noodles swell,\Nit won’t taste good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon appetit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow to cool it down, and don’t be in such a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s so interesting about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ming Dynasty Tactics Manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactics manual?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.77,0:03:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Military tactics?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you planning to start a war?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want to strengthen power,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will need army support.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have nightmares about
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,how will you die without achieving anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.45,0:03:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Case by case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If this happens,\Nit’s not because you’re stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It was originally intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop torturing yourself like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You still can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,interfere with fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wake up from a nightmare,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and strange thoughts come to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That this dream is real,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and we live in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As if all this were my visions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,just before death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And at this very moment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a chance to do something, to fix everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite possibly now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I do everything to resist fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of this man, whose destiny is to lose,\NI wanted to sacrifice everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All-in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You will definitely defeat them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am always on the side of the winners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And while I’m around,\Nvictory is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attitude is very encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As you said,\Nthat I am a man from the distant future?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I remember.\NIt’s hard to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What if this is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will share my knowledge with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,think that I had a dream.\NA useful prophetic dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this is just a dream,\NI won’t believe your stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but I’ll listen with pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.39,0:06:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Joseon like 200 years later?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a story I made up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but we no longer call our country Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Republic of Korea.\NThis is what Joseon is waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Republic of Korea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In this country, people themselves choose\Nwho will rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me something more believable so that I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don’t believe me now,\Nwe have problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just my invention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,200 years later there are no nobles and commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,People are no longer divided into classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, people came up with something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a money bag or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A person’s status is determined by his bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And what, everyone chooses a ruler using a bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is called voting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When you turn 18,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you can choose rulers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Choose rulers?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why exactly at 18?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how the queen’s day went.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch her every action.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Benin,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you are now\Nour youngest Minister of War
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and became even more attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Of course not.\N-I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Benin,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.95,0:08:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing for our family at all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,can’t get along with the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He is very important to the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and he doesn’t look like a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All his sympathy for the queen is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For his own benefit\Nhe will always risk her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the most annoying thing about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hides behind masks and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Behaves duplicitously\Nand treacherously deceives everyone around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen also succumbed to his charms,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and now for the sake of the king\NI’m ready to give up my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the king only uses her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But I heard that it was the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,twists the king as he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And who,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so the servants know better than anyone about the king’s personal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They say they were there until dawn last night
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,they were chatting in the king’s chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cheoljong fails,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,will the world change after 200 years too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there will be no Japanese annexation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and that bastard Director Khan will not be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All this is not for Cheoljong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Helping you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saving myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!\NYour father has fallen unconscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-What happened?\N-It’s dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No! It's much more dangerous in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, stay home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do everything to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have fainted\Nfrom worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s as if I personally fed you this poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote that stupid book\Nand didn’t follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They did the wrong thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not your fault, so stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Better take care of your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm healthy as an ox.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you are happy, I am too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,renounce the title of queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Dad.\N-Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,When your mother was pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,she always repeated something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted her child to be much happier than her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So that you live your life the way she couldn’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So that your life is better\Nthan that of your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This was her last wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Since after death
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,can I look your mother in the eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.71,0:12:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely fulfill my mother’s wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take revenge on them for everything they did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can't root for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a request for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen. You can ask for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sale from stock
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The owner has gone crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life I would never have thought that he was like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they then force you to pay twice as much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.02,0:13:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kim! Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.13,0:13:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Long life to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sold him a bag of rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It just flew like a cuckoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The gentleman has lost his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a request for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about corruption,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,take care of your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to sell all this to the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t drag all this to the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, won’t you let me go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.01,0:14:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Greed is a bad habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.29,0:14:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father made an important decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You were looking for the accounting book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa remembers everything that was written in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ministers, but garbage rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:48.81,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The left adviser carried out fraud with grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:51.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,In various ways he appropriated
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:52.81,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,a huge amount of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:58.08,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,The chief adviser warmed his hands on the lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:01.25,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,For example, he will slip someone a quarry and force them to work on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:02.76,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and then crush you with exorbitant taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:06.39,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,There is no one who does not steal,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.39,0:15:07.56,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and there is nothing that is not stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:10.03,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And also military corruption and the purchase of positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.10,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Instead of sending a boat with salt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:13.50,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,they filled it with stones and drowned it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.03,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,and they took the salt for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:17.87,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Similar tricks were performed with gifts for the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:20.24,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And among all this,\N who pissed me off the most,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:22.14,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,so these are moneylenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:24.08,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,They raised taxes on the peasants,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:25.81,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and then lent them money at 5%.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:28.18,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So the debts will grow with every breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:31.82,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Behavior like gangsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:34.59,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Memory of your father regarding profit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:37.09,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:40.79,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,By the way, tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:44.10,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,what will you do with the informant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:48.93,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Your father was a key figure in all these machinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:51.90,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,His crimes will not disappear like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:55.51,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-However...\N-What is “however”?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:58.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,To me, your father is another corrupt criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:02.68,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,However
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:06.25,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,he is your only blood relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.86,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What if so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.06,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,They say
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,which is a lot of merit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.73,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,can justify the shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.53,0:16:20.67,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Does he need more merit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.07,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,For example?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:23.47,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:26.51,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,he can help get evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:31.14,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,It’s hard to punish them with just a ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:35.15,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,In return you guarantee protection
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:37.12,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,informant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:38.65,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:48.09,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it’s time for the royal council.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:49.60,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:16:57.54,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Royal Council?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:02.98,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,If you want to burn garbage, go to the landfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:05.88,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Only, except for the regent - the dowager queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,women are not allowed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:11.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I appoint my brother, Prince Yeonpyeong,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:14.09,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,by the head of Ijeongcheon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:16.22,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-You shouldn’t do that.\N-You shouldn’t do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:19.26,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Why is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:22.19,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Such work and responsibility are too great
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:25.43,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,for such an inexperienced young man as Prince Yeonpyeong, he will not be able to cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:29.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,On the contrary, he is not associated with anyone powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:34.27,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,This is the highest virtue for managing Ijeongcheon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:36.48,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,In addition,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:41.85,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,does it look like I’m asking you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:49.89,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Burn, Cheoljong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:55.49,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I sent a secret inspector to Yeungnam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:58.06,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Perpetrators of abuse of power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:17:59.70,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,will be punished in accordance with the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:01.60,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Everything they misappropriated,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:04.40,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,will be used to help the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:08.81,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,This will become an example for our eight governors
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:11.31,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and will force them to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:14.31,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,-We object, Your Majesty.\N-We object, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:19.12,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The Minister of War has already sent military leaders there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.59,0:18:22.82,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,They were sent without my permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.62,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Recently
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:26.93,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,monstrous incidents caused by the followers of Tonhak,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:28.79,Default,Biryulka2,0,0,0,,reminiscent of the uprisings that used to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:31.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,threatened the sovereignty of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:34.87,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,There was a crisis, and it requires quick solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.87,0:18:36.94,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I’m sure that the border department does what it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:44.58,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Tonghak's followers rioted
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.41,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and threatened civil servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.78,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,In the end, they caused harm to officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:53.65,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,We had to quickly capture and punish the gang leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:56.42,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,To avoid repetition,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:58.62,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,it was necessary to eradicate the source of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.69,0:19:01.13,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Eradicate the source of evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:03.00,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,We captured, imprisoned and punished
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:06.97,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,followers and disseminators of the teachings of Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:10.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,They blamed all the problems of Joseon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:12.00,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,on a gang of bandits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:14.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,To eradicate the true source of evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:16.84,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I will allow Ijeongcheon to conduct an investigation in the interests of the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.21,0:19:20.38,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Sitting on the throne
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:22.11,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,the essence of the people cannot be understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:25.75,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Once you start fulfilling their demands, there will be no end to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:28.45,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,We must suppress them by force,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:32.22,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,to make sure that uprisings do not happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:35.06,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-We agree, Your Majesty.\N-We agree, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:46.34,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I will check all the prisoners to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:49.14,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,that among them there are no innocent victims of lawlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.91,0:19:52.61,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Besides, I will severely punish the bandits,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:54.71,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,so that there is an example for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.41,0:19:57.78,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And I will order the governors and military leaders to be punished,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:00.05,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,those responsible for our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:18.60,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Wants to suppress the uprising only with the help of the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:22.37,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,How naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:25.81,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Before the uprising gets out of control,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:29.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I will send troops and subjugate the followers of Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.25,0:20:32.55,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:35.45,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Apply the elixir before my face gets dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:39.53,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it’s over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:48.23,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Should I ask the queen to do more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:49.77,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:51.57,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Of course not. Forget what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:53.44,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,-You can go.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:08.29,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Still can’t forgive the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:10.42,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I would read her correspondence with the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:12.36,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,wouldn’t have asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:14.73,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Forgiveness will not solve the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:17.70,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,There is nothing but nonsense in their love letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.97,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,They even wanted to give their lives for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:42.92,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And this is the reward for my devotion to your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:45.02,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You framed my family and we were expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.02,0:21:46.29,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Made us out to be rebels
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:47.53,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and deprived of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.53,0:21:49.80,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,How could you leave us to our fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:54.90,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Consider yourself lucky that you were not executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.47,0:22:00.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,At least your family is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.15,0:22:14.95,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Come work for me in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.49,0:22:17.99,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I will prove,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.99,0:22:20.96,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,that I’m different from my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:32.40,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Booze tastes best during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.40,0:22:33.51,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.17,0:22:37.54,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Drinking in the middle of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.11,0:22:42.41,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Oh, shrimp. Rare product.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.59,0:22:48.82,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,-Who are you?\N-Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:51.19,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You’ve been drinking here all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:54.19,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,What? How dare you talk to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:56.53,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Who are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:22:58.80,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.60,0:23:02.74,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:04.64,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I am a secret inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.31,0:23:10.64,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Oh, that’s how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.11,0:23:17.52,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I heard that these days there are fake secret inspectors here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:19.22,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I don’t buy your trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.05,0:23:23.02,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,The token no longer has the same power as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:34.87,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The Secret Inspector has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:37.47,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.47,0:23:42.04,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Nowadays, a gun works more reliably than a token.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.38,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Here is a splinter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:54.52,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,We are men. We don't serve tea with sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:23:58.49,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,I wonder why she called us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.49,0:24:01.73,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The king uses a whip. And the queen is a gingerbread.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.16,0:24:03.70,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is their plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:08.50,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Probably wants to show that we are from the same clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:10.40,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,But this won’t work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:13.67,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,We can just play along.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.77,0:24:16.71,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,-Of course.\N-Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.05,0:24:23.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,, Quite a long time has passed since my accession to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.92,0:24:26.82,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,But I never invited my clan to the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.89,0:24:29.72,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I've been very busy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:31.99,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.03,0:24:39.36,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,It’s not a lot here, but I cooked for you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.60,0:24:41.70,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.84,0:24:54.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,This is wine, not tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.85,0:24:57.32,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Pretend it’s tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:24:59.52,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The king ordered to reduce the number of dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.65,0:25:02.25,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,How else can his subjects get together and have a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.55,0:25:03.69,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,But if he finds out...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.03,0:25:18.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You deceived us, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.74,0:25:21.04,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Have you set us up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.14,0:25:23.14,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Incredible.\N-How could she?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.38,0:25:28.11,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Stop making me angry. Spoil the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.85,0:25:31.15,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,But you made us angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.15,0:25:34.62,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What? Who do you take us for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.02,0:25:39.79,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I know exactly who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.56,0:25:43.90,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You are the evil of this society.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.60,0:25:46.83,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Evil?\N-Evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.33,0:25:53.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,In your language - you are the plague of this era.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.01,0:25:54.81,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-What?\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.81,0:25:57.34,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Why should we tolerate such treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.68,0:25:58.84,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:01.31,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Why did you arrange this for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.41,0:26:04.52,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Good question. Glad you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:07.62,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,No wonder the chief adviser, you are very smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.62,0:26:08.75,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.66,0:26:11.66,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Are you asking why I arranged this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.82,0:26:17.66,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I’m trying to tell you not to get in the way of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.60,0:26:23.17,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You will resist his ideas,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.87,0:26:27.07,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,know that I will come from the back and at once
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.07,0:26:29.47,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I’ll kill everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.71,0:26:31.94,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Consider you warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.25,0:26:42.02,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,If your goal is to create lawlessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.02,0:26:44.19,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,hiding behind the clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.69,0:26:48.29,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.06,0:26:51.06,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Queen, you are also one of the Andonian Kims.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:53.80,Default,Biryulka2,0,0,0,,So I decided to change my last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:56.47,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Now I’m not Kim So-yeon. I'm Chan Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.47,0:26:59.17,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-What?\N-What the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.14,0:27:04.38,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I guess they are so dense, because the clan helped them get positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.38,0:27:05.61,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hit your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.61,0:27:07.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,No more objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.81,0:27:09.72,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,No disputes. No collusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.72,0:27:11.18,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,No trips to Okthajeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.18,0:27:13.25,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What does Okthajon have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.52,0:27:15.82,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Well, I can’t go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.02,0:27:20.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The order was carried out without any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.17,0:27:26.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.00,0:27:31.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I came today with a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.81,0:27:35.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Now that you have united with my clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.31,0:27:38.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,don’t threaten or harm the queen anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:40.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,she is also from our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.28,0:27:45.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Our enemy is the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:50.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Threatening each other with swords,\Nwe will only help the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.86,0:27:53.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.67,0:27:57.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No more shamanic rituals and talismans. I abandoned them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.93,0:28:05.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.62,0:28:18.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, I should read books of this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.82,0:28:20.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,to better understand the language.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.83,0:28:23.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It's hard to swear in a friendly manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.02,0:28:27.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where can I read about Joseon slang words?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.46,0:28:30.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There are no such books in this library.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:31.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:34.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Turn to the novels,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.64,0:28:36.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,sold in a shop outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.00,0:28:39.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.97,0:28:43.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I heard about them. But I never read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.82,0:28:46.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I know a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.71,0:28:49.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,About a faithful wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.18,0:28:51.01,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,died after her husband’s betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.01,0:28:53.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Her spirit returned with a mole near her mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:54.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,to take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:57.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What a familiar story.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.86,0:28:59.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What is the name of the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.13,0:29:00.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"Temptation of the wife."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.90,0:29:02.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You didn’t read.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.10,0:29:06.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I only know the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:09.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And also? What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.67,0:29:11.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This one came out recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:12.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,About the noble lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.64,0:29:15.67,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,Her husband started an affair with the neighbor's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.67,0:29:17.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"The world of a married couple."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.38,0:29:22.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lady Choi, why are you so worried, haven’t you read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.12,0:29:24.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.42,0:29:29.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All women react the same way to such stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.72,0:29:37.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.46,0:29:39.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.07,0:29:43.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.44,0:29:52.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You need the support of the clan to ensure your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.05,0:29:55.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why ruin your relationship with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.51,0:29:56.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It seems you forgot,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.98,0:29:59.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,that these old men tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.45,0:30:01.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I do my best to build bridges,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.72,0:30:03.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,so you can return.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.45,0:30:05.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t want to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.49,0:30:07.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I tried my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.96,0:30:10.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,to woo the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.46,0:30:12.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn’t work so hard even in the Blue House.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.73,0:30:16.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And what did I get in response?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.58,0:30:17.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Poisoned ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.70,0:30:19.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is because of rumors spread by the Cho clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.55,0:30:22.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.27,0:30:24.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.97,0:30:26.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Better sooner than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.01,0:30:30.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will not return your feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.39,0:30:32.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and I can’t use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.78,0:30:33.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:37.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,chose a different path,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.80,0:30:39.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,we’d better each go our own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.84,0:30:45.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I belong to you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.97,0:30:53.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.41,0:30:57.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If he disappears, I will do everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.12,0:30:59.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,whatever you ask. Why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.82,0:31:06.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s not about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.89,0:31:09.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have no feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.03,0:31:25.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t let go of my hand, Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.11,0:31:29.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.71,0:32:13.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You must portray
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.45,0:32:15.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,every detail, every strand of hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.25,0:32:18.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Reflect not only the appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.13,0:32:19.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but also inner strength and dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.66,0:32:21.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don't use your own style.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.17,0:32:32.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.24,0:32:35.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.31,0:32:37.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn’t say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.27,0:32:41.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.51,0:32:45.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.10,0:32:51.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.90,0:32:55.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,When I smile like that, my voice sounds like a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:32:58.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And when the eyes cross, the voice sounds like a eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.88,0:33:05.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Not funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.97,0:33:09.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s very difficult to make you laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.58,0:33:10.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.55,0:33:14.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,When I bend down, I speak like a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.35,0:33:17.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And when I straighten up, I speak like a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.92,0:33:19.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Not funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.83,0:33:29.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You're laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.23,0:33:31.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.69,0:33:34.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Take your pose.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.11,0:33:36.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll make you laugh later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.31,0:33:42.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way, why do you need this portrait?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.08,0:33:44.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,According to the “Cho” and “Chon” rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.35,0:33:46.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,King Seongjong will be called Sunjo with honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.65,0:33:51.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,which means they will respect me too,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.21,0:33:52.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,for wanting to honor his memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.75,0:33:55.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Rule "Cho" and "Chon"...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.33,0:33:57.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I heard about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.92,0:34:00.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,When choosing the posthumous name of the king
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.26,0:34:02.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"Cho" is used for those who have made a great contribution,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.72,0:34:05.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and “Chon” is for those who are famous for virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.34,0:34:07.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Exactly, now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.70,0:34:15.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I brought what you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.68,0:34:18.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.32,0:34:28.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Looks cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:30.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you want to learn fencing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:31.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.36,0:34:34.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t even need to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.67,0:34:36.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm the best with knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.20,0:34:41.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is a gift for a special person.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.61,0:34:44.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Special?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.26,0:35:08.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.97,0:35:10.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So you were waiting for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.67,0:35:12.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Well, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.40,0:35:14.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You were kicked out,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.51,0:35:17.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I wasn’t sure it was worth messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.97,0:35:19.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.28,0:35:21.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You proposed an alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.95,0:35:23.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but they left without saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.68,0:35:25.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You couldn’t keep your husband under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.92,0:35:28.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So you didn’t ensure my safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.22,0:35:34.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You see, I had a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.26,0:35:36.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Until you challenged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.59,0:35:38.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.43,0:35:40.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Live a calm, boring life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.63,0:35:45.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Draw your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.80,0:35:50.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don't fight women.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.80,0:35:55.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is a gift regarding the removal from office.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.11,0:36:01.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All your achievements are marked on the blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.22,0:36:03.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.82,0:36:15.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is the life you led.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.09,0:36:18.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You said that I don't care about anything
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.09,0:36:22.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,is not capable, because I am a woman, not a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.84,0:36:26.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wait. I will show my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.78,0:36:30.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No more obstacles to my words or deeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.65,0:36:32.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,because I have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.20,0:36:52.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the main concubine has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.43,0:36:54.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let him come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.84,0:37:10.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.05,0:37:16.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I put my thoughts in order while I was shooting with a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.05,0:37:17.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Found peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.05,0:37:20.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.90,0:37:24.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s late, and you still have a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.09,0:37:26.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.84,0:37:34.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Initial instructions for children
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.49,0:37:50.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If I knew how much you would treasure this book,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.80,0:37:52.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I would try to leave it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.49,0:37:54.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Look at these scribbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.80,0:38:05.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It seems you are busy. I've taken up too much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:06.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.22,0:38:13.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.49,0:38:17.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn’t have time to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.26,0:38:21.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I liked you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.38,0:38:25.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,not only because of the meeting at the well
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.45,0:38:27.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.53,0:38:30.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,When I returned to Hanyang and met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.86,0:38:33.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I liked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.34,0:38:40.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Prince Yeonpyeong has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.47,0:38:48.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Didn’t know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.92,0:38:50.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I was about to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.68,0:38:53.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’ll leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.24,0:39:08.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What were you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.18,0:39:13.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Turn away from the truth that no one needs,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.97,0:39:16.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,would be more correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.45,0:39:49.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Eyes full of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.11,0:39:53.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So passionate about social sciences.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:40:00.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You've been waiting for my lesson all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.32,0:40:04.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t believe you, but you can tell
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.13,0:40:05.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,stories about the future, like last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.59,0:40:07.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lesson topic for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.18,0:40:27.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Constitutional monarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.92,0:40:30.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Constitutional monarchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.65,0:40:32.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There are monarchs, but they do not rule the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.99,0:40:37.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The ruler exists, but the people also have power.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.03,0:40:41.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is a country called Bhutan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.90,0:40:43.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Strange name for a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.86,0:40:46.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is a king with an even stranger name, Jigme Khesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.97,0:40:49.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There used to be an absolute monarchy, like in Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.43,0:40:51.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But he changed it to a constitutional monarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.51,0:40:52.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:55.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He was afraid that a tyrant might ascend the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.84,0:40:57.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,which will destroy the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.92,0:41:00.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So he introduced a constitutional system.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.45,0:41:02.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He rules the country based on the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.22,0:41:04.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So the kingdom is just a symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.68,0:41:07.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Jigme Khesar is smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.22,0:41:10.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What Chinese character did he use to write “Ji”?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.90,0:41:31.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.74,0:41:33.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.88,0:41:35.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.92,0:41:40.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Dude, you've had too much to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.18,0:41:41.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Forgot where your house is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.68,0:41:45.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You know what? I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.03,0:41:48.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I need to go home and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.17,0:41:57.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t have a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.70,0:42:02.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.61,0:42:09.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have nowhere to go, I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.68,0:42:13.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.24,0:42:33.57,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I liked you \Nnot only because of the meeting at the well
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.57,0:42:35.51,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.28,0:42:38.32,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.01,0:42:41.78,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,He could not find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.86,0:42:55.09,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You cannot enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.09,0:42:56.59,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I must see the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.34,0:42:59.20,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.70,0:43:06.93,Default,shooting 4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.57,0:43:47.92,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,So you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.92,0:43:50.22,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,so that I finish the book on tactics with the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.49,0:43:52.26,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,dressed as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.78,0:43:55.03,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.88,0:43:58.22,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Throw away your prejudices.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.40,0:43:59.65,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,She creates weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.65,0:44:01.49,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,which no one has seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.97,0:44:06.57,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Well, let's listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.61,0:44:10.88,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Before that, let's talk about the lethal method of training soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.18,0:44:12.84,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Why not start with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.95,0:44:16.05,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Deadly method?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.92,0:44:21.42,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.68,0:44:22.72,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.72,0:44:26.26,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I can’t hear you. Is that all you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.09,0:44:30.18,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Okay, I understand everything. Let's talk about weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.55,0:44:32.99,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,14 approaches in total. This is the 8th.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.97,0:44:37.09,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Don’t say the last number.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.30,0:44:39.86,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,If you name it, you start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.26,0:44:43.57,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.90,0:44:44.90,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.70,0:44:46.97,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.97,0:44:48.90,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-Look straight.\N-Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.07,0:44:51.61,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,It is dangerous to allow her into military strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.92,0:44:54.82,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,The Queen declared war on her clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.78,0:44:58.38,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,She no longer needs to prove that she is for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.09,0:45:02.18,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.18,0:45:04.86,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-Raise your feet.\N-2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.13,0:45:06.49,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-Eight.\N-Past.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.26,0:45:08.76,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Eight is the last number.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.32,0:45:11.09,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.09,0:45:12.86,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Wait. This killer method
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.86,0:45:14.51,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,ends when I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.51,0:45:16.20,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.70,0:45:18.01,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-Come on.\N-One.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.03,0:45:20.28,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.32,0:45:34.13,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Slowly turning into a monster -
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.53,0:45:39.59,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,and you don’t notice it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.13,0:45:51.70,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,This fake entry
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.70,0:45:54.01,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,enough to remove the left advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.84,0:45:57.20,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-Take care of him.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.18,0:46:03.05,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the main concubine has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.82,0:46:04.99,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.86,0:46:18.40,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.84,0:46:23.93,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong, could you please leave us?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.61,0:46:26.63,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-Your Highness.\N-Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.11,0:46:39.88,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Lately you often talk to the queen in the evenings.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.05,0:46:42.99,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,May I know what you discussed?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.36,0:46:45.90,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,We talked about how I see the future of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.80,0:46:51.09,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I thought I would be the only one with whom you would share your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.30,0:46:53.59,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,While the queen was getting closer to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.59,0:46:57.13,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,all I did was hesitate because of someone else's lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.90,0:47:03.01,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,But I won’t allow this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.15,0:47:06.78,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Initial instructions for children
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.51,0:47:09.88,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.15,0:47:16.68,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You already knew about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.95,0:47:20.20,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Then why didn’t they say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.53,0:47:22.57,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Because it won't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.57,0:47:24.74,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Why won't this change anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.13,0:47:29.24,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You don't trust me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.90,0:47:34.01,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You don't look at me the same way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.38,0:47:36.80,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Because of one single lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.38,0:47:40.11,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,time spent with you will not disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.68,0:47:44.01,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,The fact that I loved you for two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.15,0:47:46.32,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,will not change.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.68,0:47:48.68,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I'm sure you did this for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.93,0:47:52.82,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Because you are such a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.80,0:47:57.36,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Do you think the fact will make me happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.70,0:47:59.74,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,that you pretended to know nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.74,0:48:02.70,Default,shooting 4,0,0,0,,-Hwajin.\N-I framed the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.28,0:48:05.40,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.53,0:48:08.24,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,found the Kim family accounting book
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.24,0:48:09.95,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,and gave it to the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:12.61,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.38,0:48:15.55,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.68,0:48:18.99,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I hate the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.11,0:48:22.32,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Did you know that this ledger
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.15,0:48:25.15,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,was it really necessary for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.32,0:48:26.80,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Knew, but gave it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.09,0:48:31.47,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,How could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.17,0:48:34.84,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You knew better than anyone else what I dreamed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.13,0:48:37.63,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You trampled my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.63,0:48:38.90,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,My dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.78,0:48:41.88,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You were my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.40,0:48:46.92,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,But your heart began to beat for the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:50.42,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You tried so hard for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.18,0:48:53.92,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,but I saw how you were reaching for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.63,0:48:58.36,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I felt so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.32,0:49:03.47,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,So I lost myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.45,0:49:18.72,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.78,0:49:22.49,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You became like this because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.05,0:49:25.68,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.42,0:49:31.05,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have loved without taking care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.97,0:49:36.32,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.86,0:49:39.40,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,and I’ll find myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.28,0:49:54.61,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,"The World of the Married Couple. Volume 1"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.61,0:49:56.49,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,What a bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.65,0:49:58.72,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.95,0:50:01.18,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,"The World of the Married Couple. Volume 2"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.45,0:50:07.93,Default,shooting range 4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, will you not go to the Hijeongjong Hall today?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.57,0:50:09.99,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Maybe I should skip it today?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.07,0:50:16.03,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,My Cheoljong will be desperately waiting for my arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.57,0:50:22.65,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Who would have thought\N that I have such a thirst for knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.78,0:50:25.11,Default,shooting 4,0,0,0,,One more page.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.36,0:50:39.40,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Kim Soyeon
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.47,0:50:45.99,Default,shooting 4,0,0,0,,Choljong, sorry, sorry. I only wanted to read one page
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.99,0:50:47.49,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,but couldn’t stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.24,0:50:49.70,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Why haven’t you changed your clothes yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.38,0:51:01.49,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,What? Why are you giving it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.18,0:51:06.72,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say I should return her to you if I want to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.59,0:51:17.32,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You can hurt someone without knowing the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.47,0:51:20.36,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.99,0:51:22.80,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,to return the book to its owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.24,0:51:33.68,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.88,0:51:36.55,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,that I didn’t recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.36,0:51:40.72,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,And you me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.18,0:51:44.65,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I wasn't honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.05,0:51:49.22,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,She returned to the owner after 8 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.99,0:51:53.13,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,We cannot get back our lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.40,0:51:56.97,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,However
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.38,0:52:01.20,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I will never leave you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.11,0:52:10.59,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,But how did you live
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.01,0:52:13.65,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,all these eight years?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.82,0:52:18.80,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You were strange then, but not that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.36,0:52:21.22,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.30,0:52:24.59,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.89,0:52:42.76,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Looks good, although I don’t know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.03,0:52:46.26,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,This is medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.50,0:52:49.70,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Everything you eat in secret should be delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.70,0:52:52.84,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Yogurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.34,0:52:56.37,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-Smells of alcohol.\N-Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.64,0:52:58.91,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,This is pear wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.14,0:53:01.04,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Made from pear flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.04,0:53:04.82,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,and drink when the scent of flowers swirls in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.82,0:53:06.98,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Will you pour a glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.15,0:53:08.65,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I only have one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.65,0:53:11.66,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Its creation requires a lot of effort, so I kept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.66,0:53:13.16,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-But because of you...\N-Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.43,0:53:16.73,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,How did you make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.66,0:53:21.30,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,First, prepare the dough by mixing water with low-fat rice powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.30,0:53:24.03,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Then let's flatten the dough and make a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.03,0:53:25.80,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Making the preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.91,0:53:29.34,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Looks like a donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.68,0:53:33.68,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.68,0:53:36.95,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,So, cook in hot water, take it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.95,0:53:39.08,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,knead and let cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.88,0:53:42.82,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Take pear flowers and pre-prepared yeast
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.82,0:53:44.56,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,and make the dough again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.82,0:53:48.59,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Place it in the jug and close the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.59,0:53:50.96,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,In three days...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.96,0:53:52.10,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Can I drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.63,0:53:55.97,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.43,0:53:59.67,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,You shake it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.67,0:54:01.47,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,And after 20 days
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.47,0:54:04.11,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,you can already drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.61,0:54:08.21,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Let time fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.88,0:54:10.61,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Insist quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.32,0:54:17.89,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Left Advisor Kim Seok-keun
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.89,0:54:19.46,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,together with local officials
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.46,0:54:23.16,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,misused farmers' labor and falsified records.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.16,0:54:24.76,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,In connection with the charge of theft
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.76,0:54:26.36,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,he will be removed from his position,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.36,0:54:28.57,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,and his property will be confiscated.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.80,0:54:30.40,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.97,0:54:35.44,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Do not approach. Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.84,0:54:37.71,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.14,0:54:40.44,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.62,0:54:49.12,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I couldn’t even think that the queen’s warning was not a farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.32,0:54:52.36,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,In place of the left advisor
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.66,0:54:54.99,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I appoint the father of concubine Min,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.99,0:54:57.29,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Min Ujina from the Yohyn clan Min.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.29,0:54:59.10,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Reconsider your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.10,0:55:01.60,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,-Reconsider your decision.\N-Reconsider your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.45,0:55:17.88,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,The conversation will be short.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.12,0:55:21.42,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,When will my regency be restored?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.49,0:55:24.66,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,This must happen before the king destroys Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.82,0:55:28.03,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Our family will no longer lose its position.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.59,0:55:30.69,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Moreover, we are gathering troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.89,0:55:33.16,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,so the king doesn’t have long left.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.16,0:55:34.43,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.43,0:55:36.70,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,I'm not known for my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.97,0:55:38.07,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.57,0:55:42.17,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,By the way, I heard something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.71,0:55:47.24,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,That the queen introduces the king to blasphemous ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.79,0:56:01.86,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,On a sleepless night I walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.86,0:56:02.93,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Light breaks through the dark night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.00,0:56:12.30,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.47,0:56:19.61,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.61,0:56:21.21,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Does she still have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.70,0:56:45.24,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Are they all followers of Tonhak?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.80,0:56:46.80,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.80,0:56:50.71,Default,shooting 4,0,0,0,,-Come out.\N-Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.71,0:56:53.11,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Why are you taking the child?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.41,0:56:55.58,Default,tier 4,0,0,0,,Dream! Dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.49,0:57:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize the handwriting?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.46,0:57:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the cipher of the followers of Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.27,0:57:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In war, all means are fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.64,0:57:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"Funds"? What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.28,0:57:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of proverb?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.88,0:57:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A grenade can be more effective than 10 soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.15,0:57:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.15,0:57:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.35,0:57:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered 15 training sessions here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.49,0:57:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds plausible, "grenade".
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.26,0:57:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you put gunpowder in such a bag and throw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.69,0:57:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll explode like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.10,0:57:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.93,0:57:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Explosive bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.87,0:57:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Do you have a bulletproof vest?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.47,0:57:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bulletproof clothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.31,0:57:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.24,0:58:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wears under armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.78,0:58:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.45,0:58:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hon!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.55,0:58:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was passing by, and the light was on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.96,0:58:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.16,0:58:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re having fun without me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.60,0:58:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe I wasn’t invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.07,0:58:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-What are you talking about.\N-God!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.80,0:58:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Lee Senman!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.57,0:58:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.38,0:58:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How worried I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.45,0:58:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally met. Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.85,0:58:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.19,0:58:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Never returned to Okthajeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.62,0:58:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I drank so much wine
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.12,0:58:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,there, hoping to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.86,0:58:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lee Senman!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.00,0:59:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off. Maybe you could introduce yourself first?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.77,0:59:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.51,0:59:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a close friend of Lee Sanman.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.94,0:59:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"Friend"? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.71,0:59:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your...\N-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.55,0:59:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. The face is somewhat familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.39,0:59:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend, Jeong Chul.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.16,0:59:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.36,0:59:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.46,0:59:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Jeong Chul.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.23,0:59:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.31,0:59:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you need to do to play like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.88,0:59:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say, wasted youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.35,0:59:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.28,0:59:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We are so similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.35,0:59:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,God, apparently this is a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.72,0:59:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you’re hiding the cards somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.02,0:59:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s hard to get a trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.49,0:59:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t blame yourself for your mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.93,0:59:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.93,0:59:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.93,1:00:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Losers get their wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.80,1:00:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.44,1:00:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Insider.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.71,1:00:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Outsider.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.61,1:00:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And a follower of his beliefs, like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.78,1:00:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.63,1:00:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.07,1:00:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to noltwigs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.71,1:00:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am confident of my victory.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.34,1:01:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they used that
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.97,1:01:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to shift the left advisor.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.81,1:01:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So... I'm sure they have the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.55,1:01:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the real battle begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.25,1:01:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.65,1:01:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start cleaning up before the bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.59,1:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don’t want to get bogged down in this,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.09,1:01:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,put aside your greed and prepare to shed blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.56,1:01:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Spill blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.80,1:01:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who sold government jobs,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.27,1:01:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,will resign of their own free will.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you got rich from grain
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.31,1:01:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,or on gifts,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.54,1:01:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,return all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.31,1:01:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And take care of those
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.22,1:02:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,who kept all the records and knew about everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.62,1:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Suicide Letter
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.62,1:02:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.72,1:02:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,who does not clean up after himself and leaves traces,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.46,1:02:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,must answer for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.57,1:02:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I overthrew the Kim clan,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.67,1:02:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin's power has only strengthened.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.34,1:02:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like there is no progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.64,1:02:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find something on Kim Byonin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.55,1:02:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he helped someone with the civil service,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.05,1:02:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can’t catch him if he didn’t get anything in return.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.22,1:02:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And that doesn’t look like it at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.72,1:02:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And those whom he helped,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.86,1:02:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,very grateful to him,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.36,1:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,we won’t be able to lure them away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.93,1:02:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He built an invincible fortress.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.41,1:02:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You are already here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.91,1:03:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t Lee Senman there yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.55,1:03:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.35,1:03:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, he is so diligent.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.52,1:03:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day he comes to play with us in the tudzhon.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.46,1:03:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you have a job?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.23,1:03:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.13,1:03:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be work?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.76,1:03:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.65,1:03:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Today it’s like you’re mine,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.82,1:03:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but you’re not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.33,1:04:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.94,1:04:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to complain about the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.61,1:04:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.25,1:04:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.22,1:04:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.95,1:04:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.76,1:04:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making me angry!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.30,1:05:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you continue, your face will rattle in manure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.84,1:05:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.77,1:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s rare to meet someone who swears better than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.78,1:05:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But let me give you some advice. If you exhale from here...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.75,1:05:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.92,1:05:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, it’s time for me to warm up too.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.32,1:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You piece... You're blowing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.16,1:05:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I’ll ask you!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.40,1:05:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.47,1:05:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Maybe together?\N-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.61,1:05:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.40,1:06:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, my wine!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.07,1:06:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You are wonderful, my wine!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.37,1:06:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.17,1:06:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You try it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.18,1:06:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,At the bottom. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.75,1:06:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.98,1:06:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful color, queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.32,1:06:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And such a delicious aroma.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.49,1:06:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Still. Perfect exposure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.79,1:06:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you both do that you lost your voices?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.20,1:06:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.24,1:06:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.21,1:06:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because I didn’t eat anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.98,1:06:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this will be for dessert!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.88,1:07:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll come back to you, my wine!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.49,1:07:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My wonderful wine!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.03,1:07:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,From the petals of blooming pears.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.29,1:07:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I came running here because I wanted to give this to you personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.63,1:07:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the book is ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.04,1:07:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"Military Training Directory"?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.91,1:07:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good name.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.31,1:07:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.58,1:07:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I just told you what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.98,1:07:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next page.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.42,1:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,On that day, Councilor Hon...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.52,1:07:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He gets incontinent every time he sees these drawings.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.26,1:07:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the drawings here look great.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.53,1:07:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.57,1:07:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.77,1:08:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t live long as a commoner, but still
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.34,1:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,struggled with loneliness
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.21,1:08:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and it was difficult for me to adapt when I got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.92,1:08:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are so unusual,\Nyou should be even more lonely.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.49,1:08:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.69,1:08:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t have time to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.66,1:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Difficulties every day and running around.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.17,1:08:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone even started a dictionary to understand me better.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.81,1:08:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, I don’t feel lonely at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.39,1:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it time for ramen?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.13,1:08:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I say or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.66,1:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.87,1:09:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not on purpose. I feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.31,1:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the royal physician immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.78,1:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.45,1:09:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.12,1:09:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.36,1:09:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.26,1:10:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.21,1:10:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My queen, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.48,1:10:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Congratulations, Your Majesty!\N-Congratulations, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.46,1:10:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a father!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.48,1:10:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.98,1:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.49,1:11:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How I became a queen
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.55,1:11:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.82,1:11:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The real school for pregnant women starts today.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.95,1:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You should refuse such unusual dishes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.79,1:11:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you spread the rumors as I instructed?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.69,1:11:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't actually sleep together.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.29,1:11:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the pose? How awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.46,1:11:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not enough to quell the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.33,1:11:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.83,1:11:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What everyone believes becomes true.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.07,1:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,First bring me the queen's head.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.60,1:11:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.97,1:11:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want to live, everyone around me will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.24,1:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will accept everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,


